  Manufactures the Xaas.Library domain, resources (Book, Checkout, HoldRequest, Curation, RecommendationLog),
  and applies pure declarative Ash resource definitions grounded in Schema.org, BIBO, and PROV ontologies.

  Usage:
      mix xaas.library.manufacture --phase base --yes
      mix xaas.library.manufacture --phase core --yes
